WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
A fraction describes equal parts of one whole.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.000
When we divide a pizza into four equal slices, each slice is one quarter.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.000
The bottom number tells us how many equal parts make the whole.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:36.000
The top number tells us how many parts we choose. Three slices are three quarters.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Now explore the pizza yourself, and see if you can show a fraction.
